EmailTemplate.textOnly:
NTE27 · Internal notification

New exhibitor application.

{!Lead.Company} has applied for exhibition space at NTE27.

Hello NTE team,

A new exhibitor application has been submitted. The key operational and commercial information is summarised below.

Next steps

• Check organisation eligibility and space availability.

• Review power, equipment, accessibility and heavy-vehicle requirements.

• Confirm pricing, quotation, purchase-order and supplier requirements.

• Record the decision before sending the appropriate approval or decline email.

